00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
More HCP engagement. Starts below plan.
What changed?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Nordhaven: 217 starts vs 340 targeted.
Engagement is up 38.1% year on year.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Investigate the gap.
Every finding links back to its evidence.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Incoming switches account for 71.5%
of the arithmetic shortfall.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
89.8% of contacts reach the top quarter of HCPs.
Reported process delays remain a hypothesis.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,000
What should we investigate next?
Audit reach. Validate delays. Test before scaling activity.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
From a performance gap to a testable next question.
Preetham Vooturi | Signal & Starts
